1
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:10,370
(Passenger Drop-off Area)

2
00:00:36,367 --> 00:00:39,256
=Vow of Autumn=
=Episode 22=

3
00:01:08,219 --> 00:01:11,000
Please exchange your rings.

4
00:01:24,956 --> 00:01:26,956
All right.

5
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:30,299
Now, please share your vows.

6
00:01:37,379 --> 00:01:38,439
From

7
00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:39,920
12

8
00:01:41,299 --> 00:01:42,540
to 28,

9
00:01:44,180 --> 00:01:45,920
it took me 16 years

10
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,379
to stand here before you.

11
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:55,719
You're not my sister by blood.

12
00:01:56,180 --> 00:01:57,700
I'm allowed to like you.

13
00:02:01,759 --> 00:02:02,919
Over the past 16 years,

14
00:02:03,579 --> 00:02:04,939
I've done so much.

15
00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:07,500
Studied medicine,

16
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,280
went abroad,

17
00:02:10,060 --> 00:02:10,599
came back,

18
00:02:11,199 --> 00:02:11,860
and waited.

19
00:02:13,759 --> 00:02:15,219
But I realized

20
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:17,360
every path

21
00:02:18,219 --> 00:02:18,939
led to you.

22
00:02:19,479 --> 00:02:22,060
Don't give up your dream for me.

23
00:02:22,060 --> 00:02:23,120
I wouldn't give up

24
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,379
my dream for you either.

25
00:02:24,379 --> 00:02:26,139
Neither of us has to do that.

26
00:02:26,419 --> 00:02:29,000
It's always been you.

27
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,159
Thank you.

28
00:02:32,719 --> 00:02:34,400
Thank you for not running away.

29
00:02:35,180 --> 00:02:37,539
And for knowing everything about me

30
00:02:38,259 --> 00:02:39,400
and still choosing me.

31
00:02:39,979 --> 00:02:40,979
(With you here,)

32
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,699
(somehow,)

33
00:02:43,180 --> 00:02:44,240
(I'm not as panicked anymore.)

34
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:46,979
Wen Wanqing.

35
00:02:47,159 --> 00:02:48,759
What are we now?

36
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,199
We're together.

37
00:02:50,500 --> 00:02:51,419
Did you hear that?

38
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,939
I'll never forget

39
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,500
the first person

40
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:56,759
who made me feel truly seen.

41
00:02:57,939 --> 00:02:58,639
It was her.

42
00:03:05,639 --> 00:03:07,199
In my life,

43
00:03:07,699 --> 00:03:09,560
I've done many things right.

44
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:11,719
But the best of all

45
00:03:12,439 --> 00:03:14,120
was that night,

46
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,919
on the dance floor,

47
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:18,120
when I couldn't resist

48
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:19,620
kissing you.

49
00:03:46,699 --> 00:03:48,300
I used to think

50
00:03:50,259 --> 00:03:52,360
marriage was where love went to die.

51
00:03:52,539 --> 00:03:54,599
(I can flirt with anyone,)

52
00:03:54,599 --> 00:03:56,120
(without catching feelings.)

53
00:03:57,439 --> 00:03:59,479
I was afraid to fall in love.

54
00:04:00,479 --> 00:04:01,659
And afraid

55
00:04:02,439 --> 00:04:04,560
to spend my whole life with someone.

56
00:04:05,039 --> 00:04:06,000
But

57
00:04:09,879 --> 00:04:12,099
if it's you,

58
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,599
I'm willing to try

59
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,740
forever.

60
00:04:43,286 --> 00:04:44,134
Yay!

61
00:04:44,319 --> 00:04:45,379
Cheese!

62
00:05:08,519 --> 00:05:09,279
Having you here

63
00:05:10,500 --> 00:05:11,060
means so much.

64
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:13,000
Thank you

65
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:14,839
for not leaving me.

66
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:16,379
And thank you

67
00:05:17,259 --> 00:05:18,339
for never giving up on me.

68
00:06:24,500 --> 00:06:26,660
Wake up, sleepyhead.

69
00:06:26,980 --> 00:06:28,279
Time to get up.

70
00:06:28,543 --> 00:06:28,797
No...

71
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,639
Five more minutes.

72
00:06:35,519 --> 00:06:37,680
No more sleeping in.

73
00:06:39,839 --> 00:06:41,240
Get up.

74
00:06:41,439 --> 00:06:42,240
Stop it.

75
00:06:46,660 --> 00:06:48,500
You're on my hair.

76
00:06:52,180 --> 00:06:53,180
Five more minutes.

77
00:06:53,180 --> 00:06:54,079
Three minutes.

78
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:54,939
Three minutes.

79
00:06:56,319 --> 00:06:57,920
Get up. I'll brush your teeth for you.

80
00:07:03,139 --> 00:07:03,600
Pull me up.

81
00:07:04,259 --> 00:07:04,639
Pull me.

82
00:07:06,241 --> 00:07:08,000
Three, two, one.

83
00:07:10,879 --> 00:07:11,339
Stand up!

84
00:07:17,660 --> 00:07:19,079
You're so sleepy.

85
00:07:36,838 --> 00:07:37,698
Ready?

86
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,300
Ready.

87
00:07:39,339 --> 00:07:40,220
Come eat.

88
00:07:43,220 --> 00:07:44,000
Look.

89
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,420
I fried you

90
00:07:45,420 --> 00:07:46,759
a really, really big egg today.

91
00:07:49,060 --> 00:07:51,060
Can we have something else tomorrow?

92
00:07:51,060 --> 00:07:52,100
What do you want, then?

93
00:07:52,279 --> 00:07:53,660
I want

94
00:07:53,660 --> 00:07:54,399
spicy pepper soup.

95
00:07:54,740 --> 00:07:55,579
Soup with what?

96
00:07:56,300 --> 00:07:57,220
Fried dough bites.

97
00:07:58,060 --> 00:07:58,680
What bites?

98
00:07:59,819 --> 00:08:00,899
Fried dough bites.

99
00:08:01,279 --> 00:08:02,240
What are dog bites?

100
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:04,620
Dough bites!

101
00:08:04,620 --> 00:08:05,120
Silly.

102
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,920
Okay. I'll look it up later.

103
00:08:06,977 --> 00:08:07,190
Okay.

104
00:08:08,180 --> 00:08:10,040
Want to watch a movie after work?

105
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:11,139
Pick me up then.

106
00:08:11,139 --> 00:08:11,879
We'll go together.

107
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:12,160
Okay.

108
00:08:12,699 --> 00:08:15,040
Let's have a decent dinner first,

109
00:08:15,399 --> 00:08:16,399
then watch a movie.

110
00:08:19,939 --> 00:08:21,079
It's 7:30!

111
00:08:21,500 --> 00:08:22,740
You always wake me up so late!

112
00:08:22,740 --> 00:08:23,639
Hurry! I'll be late!

113
00:08:23,639 --> 00:08:24,639
You wouldn't get up!

114
00:08:24,759 --> 00:08:25,680
Let's go!

115
00:09:14,300 --> 00:09:16,100
(Passenger Drop-off Area)
